(6963752, 1049909, 103142, '<td valign="top">Hahah!! I had the same idea. Although with our own city garbage can. But it stinks so badly, and I didn''t have time to bleach it out.<br/> <br/>I sincerely hope that you indeed got in there yourself and used a remote or had someone trigger it. The challenge was to take a shot of your left foot -- and if this was indeed your foot -- you''ll definitely have had more of an experience to remember than if you used a foot model. :)<br/> <br/>-8-</td>', 'Hahah!! I had the same idea. Although with our own city garbage can. But it stinks so badly, and I didn''t have time to bleach it out. I sincerely hope that you indeed got in there yourself and used a remote or had someone trigger it. The challenge was to take a shot of your left foot -- and if this was indeed your foot -- you''ll definitely have had more of an experience to remember than if you used a foot model. :) -8-', '2013-01-24 10:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
