(6964330, 1049733, 103142, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by h2:</b></div><hr/><i> Must that really be discussed here? I was aware of being DNMCed as I already stated in the comments section.<br/> <br/>Regarding basic editing and lighting: Where''s the difficulty here? One flash bounced of the ceiling, slightly underexposed; basically only WB correction and exposure/contrast adjustments in LR. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I''ve never been successful at bouncing, and there were no hot spots, and the whites were so clean... anyway, maybe I just need to shoot in a bathroom to get basic right. Whenever I have a white background and a darker subject, I always seem to need advanced editing to get it to work. White bathrooms, here I come!!</td>', 'Originally posted by h2: Must that really be discussed here? I was aware of being DNMCed as I already stated in the comments section. Regarding basic editing and lighting: Where''s the difficulty here? One flash bounced of the ceiling, slightly underexposed; basically only WB correction and exposure/contrast adjustments in LR.   I''ve never been successful at bouncing, and there were no hot spots, and the whites were so clean... anyway, maybe I just need to shoot in a bathroom to get basic right. Whenever I have a white background and a darker subject, I always seem to need advanced editing to get it to work. White bathrooms, here I come!!', '2013-01-25 10:30:57.000000', NULL, 0),
